        <chat_id> <message_id>" line. That exact printed follow-up
        command is guaranteed to fail, since D2TG::Store::get_attachment_path
        reads local_path from the messages table, which was never
        written in this case.
      - cli/retry-download.pl now branches on $still_queued: when true,
        it prints "RETRY PARTIAL" instead of "RETRY OK", explains the
        history record could not be written yet, names the row as still
        queued for automatic or manual retry, and sets a non-zero exit
        code - instead of falsely claiming full success. Added
