        failed_downloads' own TGT-221 migration).
      - Added D2TG::Download::auto_retry_failed_transcriptions, reusing
        the existing retry_failed_transcription (TGT-237) for the
        actual retry attempt. Deliberately does not trust
        retry_failed_transcription's own ($ok, $result) return value to
