0.66  2026-09-08
      - FIX (TGT-090, live user request + live reproduction): a resolved
        --db/-d/D2TG_DB alias's target directory, or a TIRA_HOME
        fallback, is now confirmed to already exist before any d2 tg.*
        command proceeds. Reproduced live in a tira:latest container:
        TIRA_HOME=foobar previously made d2 tg.unread silently mkdir -p
        ./foobar/.tira/ and create telegram.messages.db inside it,
        rooted wherever the current working directory happened to be.
