        cli/help.pl). Confirmed first, before renaming anything, that
        Developer Dashboard's SkillDispatcher (_runnable_path_candidates
        in Platform.pm) already tries a .pl fallback for an extensionless
        command name, so d2 tg.<command> dispatch is unaffected - verified
