0.80  2026-09-08
      - FEATURE (TGT-103, user-supplied feature-gap analysis): the old
        ~/skills/tg blueprint had two dedicated senders for pushing a
        local file to Telegram as a photo or document message - this
        skill had no outbound-media primitive at all. New
